(6867176, 1034308, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1<br/>Simple. On the bottom arch on the right side there are two red spots, those need to be cleaned up, but otherwise the image is spot on. It''s expert editing so the non-photos will mop this up, but I did my part to help you out.</td>', '#1Simple. On the bottom arch on the right side there are two red spots, those need to be cleaned up, but otherwise the image is spot on. It''s expert editing so the non-photos will mop this up, but I did my part to help you out.', '2012-09-21 11:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
