(6867209, 1034409, 63218, '<td valign="top">Oh those little trees! even a distant bird, as though a stone virgin as big as a mountain was an everyday occurrence. And the light is beautifully done.</td>', 'Oh those little trees! even a distant bird, as though a stone virgin as big as a mountain was an everyday occurrence. And the light is beautifully done.', '2012-09-21 12:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6867217, 1033799, 63218, '<td valign="top">a masterpiece of suggestive blur</td>', 'a masterpiece of suggestive blur', '2012-09-21 12:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6867246, 1034437, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. The dreamy air, mix of textures, the complementary colors, the subject, all combine to make an excellent Virgo portrait. And the camera angle is just right. My problem is I can''t understand why you left the detail in the lower left corner, or the detail in the yellow part of the ceiling next to the skylight, or the two little details on the window in the corner. Instead of admiring this fine image, I was scrolling up/down to see if I needed to clean my screen. I didn''t take any points off for these details, which I do not love, but maybe you do. The white details above/behind the figure''s right shoulder on the other hand, I see as contributing to the air, like the blur in the lower r corner. Either way, a much more interesting shot than usual from such a setting. It encouraged me to think. Good for you!</td>', 'This is wonderful. The dreamy air, mix of textures, the complementary colors, the subject, all combine to make an excellent Virgo portrait. And the camera angle is just right. My problem is I can''t understand why you left the detail in the lower left corner, or the detail in the yellow part of the ceiling next to the skylight, or the two little details on the window in the corner. Instead of admiring this fine image, I was scrolling up/down to see if I needed to clean my screen. I didn''t take any points off for these details, which I do not love, but maybe you do. The white details above/behind the figure''s right shoulder on the other hand, I see as contributing to the air, like the blur in the lower r corner. Either way, a much more interesting shot than usual from such a setting. It encouraged me to think. Good for you!', '2012-09-21 13:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6867281, 1033944, 63218, '<td valign="top">Points added for humor and style. Well done.</td>', 'Points added for humor and style. Well done.', '2012-09-21 14:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
