(6867691, 1034361, 62249, '<td valign="top">Background is not very appealing, and the model''s right hand in the pink-dress shot is covering too much of her face. You need more DOF to have the faces *and* the pointing fingers in focus. But the idea of the twosome (not sure if this is same woman twice or real twins) is good.</td>', 'Background is not very appealing, and the model''s right hand in the pink-dress shot is covering too much of her face. You need more DOF to have the faces *and* the pointing fingers in focus. But the idea of the twosome (not sure if this is same woman twice or real twins) is good.', '2012-09-22 17:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
