(6868069, 1034286, 124815, '<td valign="top">To me this image embodies the perils of wanting to say/show too much<br/>The ungainly, clumsy figure placed somewhat randomly adds unnecessary story to an otherwise pleasant image.</td>', 'To me this image embodies the perils of wanting to say/show too muchThe ungainly, clumsy figure placed somewhat randomly adds unnecessary story to an otherwise pleasant image.', '2012-09-23 20:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6868158, 1034428, 97225, '<td valign="top">You have done some great work here, but I feel that the image is let down by the horse, which looks very toyish. I feel a bit mean saying that because I love the image in general, but that is what has kept me from giving you a 10.</td>', 'You have done some great work here, but I feel that the image is let down by the horse, which looks very toyish. I feel a bit mean saying that because I love the image in general, but that is what has kept me from giving you a 10.', '2012-09-23 23:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
