(6868966, 1034409, 94134, '<td valign="top">Damn it this better win! This will def ribbon but it better win.  The only aquarius ive seen and I love it(partly because im aquarius) but a lot of technique in this and its seamless.  I wish I had a hi res-version of this to make it my desktop background its that good to me!<br/> <br/>Def beats the only other aquarius by a mile. Great job.</td>', 'Damn it this better win! This will def ribbon but it better win.  The only aquarius ive seen and I love it(partly because im aquarius) but a lot of technique in this and its seamless.  I wish I had a hi res-version of this to make it my desktop background its that good to me! Def beats the only other aquarius by a mile. Great job.', '2012-09-25 02:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
