(6871456, 1034412, 113278, '<td valign="top">My self portraits would do much better if I looked like you lol. Great work, the sign drawn in the stars was a very nice touch. Posing like that and combing the shots to look like it was one shot of twins is really good work. Not easy at all but you made it believable. You are keeping great company at the top but now there are even more contenders to fight against in expert editing :)</td>', 'My self portraits would do much better if I looked like you lol. Great work, the sign drawn in the stars was a very nice touch. Posing like that and combing the shots to look like it was one shot of twins is really good work. Not easy at all but you made it believable. You are keeping great company at the top but now there are even more contenders to fight against in expert editing :)', '2012-09-28 20:13:50.000000', NULL, 0),
